<h2 style="color: #DC2626; margin-top: 0; font-weight: 800; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.4px;">Action Required: Courier Verification</h2>
<p style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1F2937; margin: 0 0 10px;">Hello <%= typeof riderName !== 'undefined' && riderName ? riderName : 'Courier Partner' %>,</p>
<p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: #4B5563; margin: 0 0 18px;">Our compliance team reviewed your GoEatOne courier application, and some information or documents require your attention before we can activate your account.</p>

<div style="background-color: #FEF2F2; border: 1.5px solid #FECACA; border-left: 4px solid #DC2626; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px; margin: 20px 0 24px;">
  <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; color: #991B1B; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;">
    Feedback from Compliance Team:
  </p>
  <p style="margin: 0; color: #B91C1C; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55;">
    <%= typeof reason !== 'undefined' && reason ? reason : 'Please review and re-upload your verification documents.' %>
  </p>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #4B5563; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 24px;">
  Please open your <strong>GoEatOne Courier Hub</strong> mobile app, navigate to your verification screen, and update the requested documents as indicated above.
</p>

<div style="margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #E5E7EB; text-align: center;">
  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #9CA3AF; margin: 0;">
    Questions about this request? Reach out to us at <a href="mailto:support@goeatone.com" style="color: #06462f; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">support@goeatone.com</a>.
  </p>
</div>
